y changed `Date.UTC()`, `setHours()` and `setSeconds()`.\n\n## Byte-identical output verification\n\nA differential harness runs the same C driver linked against each `.so`:\n- **31 JS test scripts × 2 modes (sloppy/strict) = 62 comparisons** — language semantics, all builtins, number formatting sweeps, Unicode, regexps, JSON, error messages, syntax errors, GC/property-tree stress\n- **4 C-API drivers, 17 modes** — internal API (grisu2/strtod/utf/regexec/buffers/iterators/stack ops), run/memory limits, panic+abort paths, custom allocator, userdata/finalizers, `debugger` stack dumps\n- **6 timezones** for the Date tests\n\nAll produce **byte-identical stdout/stderr and identical exit codes** (including matching `SIGABRT`). Under this suite the C library reaches **93.94% line coverage with every function executed**, and the debug build of the Rust crate matches too."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1086,"cache_read_input_tokens":538708,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1086,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e63ba36-2d65-497f-a5b2-8fd6eb67db8b","uuid":"649a8ad7-59f3-4b8d-bfe0-b2bf16670537","timestamp":"2026-08-22T22:08:49.547Z"}
